<text for="L6">万里晴空 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(万里晴空)</span></text><text for="L7">好像快要掉下来了</text><text for="L8">好像 好像 真要掉下来了！ <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(好像 真要掉下来了！)</span></text><text for="L9">小小的我啊</text><text for="L10">口-阿 啊 伴我身边 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(口-阿 伴我身边)</span></text><text for="L11">小小的我啊</text><text for="L12">依然 啊在我身边 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(依然 啊在我身边)</span></text><text for="L13">即使假装看不见 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(看不见)</span></text><text for="L14">即使打算忘记 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(忘记)</span></text><text for="L15">即使尖锐的疼痛 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(痛楚)</span></text><text for="L16">时刻在我身边 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(身边)</span></text><text for="L17">这般 这般 小小的我</text><text for="L18">貌似一阵风便能吹跑吧</text><text for="L19">飞吧 飞走了的话 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(飞吧 飞走了的话)</span></text><text for="L20">不刚好吗</text><text for="L21">小小的我啊</text><text for="L22">口-阿 啊 依然在意着 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(口-阿 啊 依然在意着)</span></text><text for="L23">小小的我啊</text><text for="L24">今天也 啊 依然在意着 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(今天也 啊 依然在意着)</span></text><text for="L25">是伤心了吗？</text><text for="L26">伤心了</text><text for="L27">感到不好意思了吗？</text><text for="L28">感到羞耻了</text><text for="L29">想停下吗？</text><text for="L30">想放弃了</text><text for="L31">想消失吗？</text><text for="L32">想消失</text><text for="L33">想流泪吗？</text><text for="L34">想流泪</text><text for="L35">这样啊</text><text for="L36">是这样呐</text><text for="L37">如此渺小的我啊</text><text for="L38">一直的 啊 存在于身边 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(一直的 啊 存在于身边)</span></text><text for="L39">这般渺小的我啊</text><text for="L40">依旧的 回荡于心间 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(依旧的 回荡于心间)</span></text><text for="L41">这样渺小的我啊</text><text for="L42">全部 无法被忽视 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(全部 无法被忽视)</span></text><text for="L43">这般小巧的我啊</text><text for="L44">今天也 啊 感慕缠怀吧 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(今天也 啊 感慕缠怀吧)</span></text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:43.791"><div begin="00:16.736" end="00:29.651" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="00:16.736" end="00:19.795" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:16.736" end="00:17.414">ずっと</span><span begin="00:17.414" end="00:17.805">前</span><span begin="00:17.805" end="00:18.026">の</span><span begin="00:18.026" end="00:18.426">気持</span><span begin="00:18.426" end="00:18.765">ち</span><span begin="00:18.765" end="00:19.795"> ​</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:19.066" end="00:19.235">(気持</span><span begin="00:19.235" end="00:19.645">ち)</span></span></p><p begin="00:20.076" end="00:23.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:20.076" end="00:20.299">捨</span><span begin="00:20.299" end="00:20.678">て</span><span begin="00:20.678" end="00:20.939">切</span><span begin="00:20.939" end="00:21.379">れ</span><span begin="00:21.379" end="00:21.818">なく</span><span begin="00:21.818" end="00:22.158">て</span><span begin="00:22.158" end="00:23.148"> ​</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:22.469" end="00:22.628">(なく</span><span begin="00:22.628" end="00:22.998">て)</span></span></p><p begin="00:23.467" end="00:26.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:23.467" end="00:24.338">心</span><span begin="00:24.338" end="00:24.769">が</span><span begin="00:24.769" end="00:24.969">足</span><span begin="00:24.969" end="00:25.198">り</span><span begin="00:25.198" end="00:25.579">ない</span><span begin="00:25.579" end="00:26.608"> ​</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:25.748" end="00:25.900">(足</span><span begin="00:25.900" end="00:26.009">り</span><span begin="00:26.009" end="00:26.458">ない)</span></span></p><p begin="00:26.489" en