" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:39.418" end="00:39.841">もう </span><span begin="00:39.841" end="00:40.289">もう </span><span begin="00:40.289" end="00:40.660">落</span><span begin="00:40.660" end="00:40.769">ち</span><span begin="00:40.769" end="00:41.151">てき</span><span begin="00:41.151" end="00:41.561">ちゃい</span><span begin="00:41.561" end="00:41.969">そう</span><span begin="00:41.969" end="00:42.389">で！</span><span begin="00:42.389" end="00:42.539"> ​</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:39.841" end="00:40.289">(もう </span><span begin="00:40.289" end="00:40.660">落</span><span begin="00:40.660" end="00:40.769">ち</span><span begin="00:40.769" end="00:41.151">てき</span><span begin="00:41.151" end="00:41.561">ちゃい</span><span begin="00:41.561" end="00:41.969">そう</span><span begin="00:41.969" end="00:42.389">で！)</span></span></p></div><div begin="00:43.548" end="00:55.904" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="00:43.548" end="00:45.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:43.548" end="00:43.872">ちっ</span><span begin="00:44.016" end="00:44.459">ちゃな</span><span begin="00:44.459" end="00:45.038">私</span><span begin="00:45.038" end="00:45.268">が</span><span begin="00:45.268" end="00:45.638">さ</span><span begin="00:45.638" end="00:45.888">​</span></p><p begin="00:45.685" end="00:49.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:45.685" end="00:46.376">あーあ </span><span begin="00:47.405" end="00:47.827">あー </span><span begin="00:47.827" end="00:47.993">繰</span><span begin="00:47.993" end="00:48.216">り</span><span begin="00:48.216" end="00:48.616">返</span><span begin="00:48.616" end="00:49.037">す</span><span begin="00:49.037" end="00:49.187"> ​</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:47.298">(あーあ </span><span begin="00:47.405" end="00:47.827">あー </span><span begin="00:47.827" end="00:47.993">繰</span><span begin="00:47.993" end="00:48.216">り</span><span begin="00:48.216" end="00:48.616">返</span><span begin="00:48.616" end="00:49.037">す)</spa